  "body": "First time on market in over 2 decades. Often sought, seldom found. Retirement dictates sale after more than 23 years of ownership. This spacious home is set on a large freehold site of approx. 698sqm in a well sought after location of Browns Bay.\r\n \r\nConveniently located close to the beach, shops, cafes, restaurants, transport, and excellent schools. Sherwood Primary and Northcross Intermediate are all within easy access from the walkway at the end of the cul-de-sac.\r\n \r\nOffering versatility to accommodate everyone in the family. The top level provides 4 generous sized bedrooms with 2 living areas, spacious modern kitchen and elevated outlook. Master bedroom comes with its own ensuite. The spacious rumpus downstairs has been partitioned to create an extra room. The bathroom, study and separate access offers flexibility to cater for extended family, visitors, teenagers retreat or an option to work from home. The generous double internal access garage, swimming pool and multiple outdoor entertaining areas are all added bonuses of this spacious family home. Three generations of memories have been created here and all the children have now flown the nest. Our owners are ready to move on to their retirement, and they are offering you a chance to create your beautiful memories in this well-loved family home. Could this be your home for the next 20 plus years? Be quick or you will miss out on this brilliant opportunity! \r\n\r\nPlease download property information from the following link https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/CZNL",
